WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.759
With Phrase, app keys sync
through Phrase Strings,

2
00:00:04.759 --> 00:00:07.324
and documents go through Phrase TMS.

3
00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.462
Phrase does this well,

4
00:00:09.462 --> 00:00:11.854
with many engines, Repo Sync,

5
00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:13.072
and vendor management.

6
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.854
General Translation translates
your app and docs together,

7
00:00:16.854 --> 00:00:18.386
with one set of terms.

8
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.914
Keep app copy in a T component,

9
00:00:21.914 --> 00:00:24.374
and add MDX pages to the config.

10
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.147
Assign one Context Group,

11
00:00:27.147 --> 00:00:28.899
so both use the same terms.

12
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.829
Then npx gt translate in CI
writes the German for both.

13
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:37.633
Your team now ships both in
German with each release.
